      "text" : "{\"schemaVersion\":\"1.8\",\"facts\":[{\"factId\":\"f1\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0003\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0018\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0020\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0021\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0024\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0030\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0035\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0037\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0048\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0051\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0053\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0055\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0058\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0061\"] ,\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"지난 2시간 동안 지속되는 어지럼(방이 빙빙 도는 느낌)과 메스꺼움이 있으며, 똑바로 걷기 어렵고 귀에서 가벼운 윙윙거림이 있다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f2\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0044\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0046\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0053\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0057\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0066\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0068\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"귀통증, 귀 분비물, 발열, 팔다리 힘 빠짐, 청력 저하/먹먹함은 없다고 했다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f3\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0024\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0055\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"이전에도 한 달 전 비슷한 어지럼이 있었고 그때는 5~10분 정도 지속되었다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f4\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0071\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0073\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"ASSESSMENT\",\"text\":\"의사는 오늘 이야기로 볼 때 가장 흔한 진단으로 labyrinthitis(미로염)을 생각할 수 있다고 설명했다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[\"UNCERTAIN_DIAGNOSIS\"]},{\"factId\":\"f5\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0074\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0084\"] ,\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"MEDICATION\",\"text\":\"약 이름은 명시되지 않았지만, 한 번에 1알씩 하루 3번, 열흘 정도 복용하도록 처방했다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"PRESCRIBED\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":{\"name\":null,\"doseText\":\"한 번에 1알\",\"frequencyText\":\"하루 3번\",\"courseDurationText\":\"열흘 정도\",\"instructions\":\"음식과 함께 먹어야 하는지는 크게 상관없고, 아침에 일어나자마자 증상이 생겨 메스꺼워 먹기 힘들면 그냥 복용해도 된다.\",\"startsOn\":null,\"endsOn\":null,\"clockTimes\":[],\"scheduleRecurrence\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[\"MEDICATION_NAME_UNKNOWN\"]},{\"factId\":\"f6\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0075\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0076\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0081\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0092\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"FOLLOW_UP\",\"text\":\"귀 안을 직접 확인하는 대면 진료를 받고, 혈압과 보행 상태를 확인한 뒤 다음 단계를 정하기로 했다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"FUTURE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":{\"kind\":\"EXAM\",\"title\":\"대면 진료 및 귀/혈압/보행 확인\",\"date\":null,\"time\":null,\"recurrence\":\"ONCE\",\"lastDate\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f7\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0077\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0079\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0078\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0080\"],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"PRECAUTION\",\"text\":\"대기 중 팔다리 힘 빠짐이나 갑작스러운 두통이 생기거나 심하게 토하기 시작하면 응급실에 가야 한다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"ANY\",\"clauses\":[\"팔다리 힘 빠짐이 생기면\",\"갑작스러운 두통이 생기면\",\"심하게 토하기 시작하면\"]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"FUTURE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":{\"kind\":\"HOSPITAL\",\"title\":\"응급실 방문\",\"date\":null,\"time\":null,\"recurrence\":\"ONCE\",\"lastDate\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f8\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0085\",\"s16d1fd758b58v1u0092\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"FOLLOW_UP\",\"text\":\"며칠 안에 의사 진료를 받아 이후 계획을 정하고, 지원팀에 전화해 예약하라고 했다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"FUTURE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":{\"kind\":\"OTHER\",\"title\":\"의사 진료 예약/연락\",\"date\":null,\"time\":null,\"recurrence\":\"ONCE\",\"lastDate\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]}],\"summaryFactIds\":[\"f4\",\"f5\",\"f6\",\"f7\",\"f8\"]}"
